@startuml OrderStateDiagram
title Lifecycle of an enquiry / order (OrderStatus)

[*] --> ENQUIRY : customer: enquire
[*] --> QUEUED : baker: add

ENQUIRY --> QUEUED : baker: accept\n(new O-prefixed ID)
ENQUIRY --> REJECTED : baker: reject
ENQUIRY --> CANCELLED : cancel

QUEUED --> PREPARING : baker: mark preparing
PREPARING --> READY : baker: mark ready
READY --> COLLECTED : baker: mark collected
QUEUED --> CANCELLED : cancel
PREPARING --> CANCELLED : cancel
READY --> CANCELLED : cancel

COLLECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]

note right of ENQUIRY
  Customers may edit or cancel
  only while in this state, and
  only with their own phone number.
end note
note right of QUEUED
  mark moves one step at a time.
  Skipping (QUEUED to READY) or
  going backwards is rejected.
end note
@enduml
